2 CONT
2 CONT * Ge Zhiwei 葛志偉. “Xiao Zong ‘Ting zhong ming' ‘Bei luo ye' shi banben kaobian” 蕭綜《聽鐘鳴》《悲落葉》詩版本考辨. Nanjing shifan daxue wenxueyuan xuebao (2011: 4): 179–81.
2 CONT
