1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Chén Wàn Shān 陳萬山 [Màn Sän] was an imperial counselor. He was buried in the plateau part of È 鄂 [Ngòk] hill in the village of Zhūjī 珠璣 [Jî Gï Lî]. His wife was from the Yú 俞 [Yĩ ] family. 
