1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My father [Fï] had seven sons. His generation name was Fùng Hõi 鳳台 (Fèngtái). He was an imperial counselor. His job was terminated when he could not negotiate peace with barbaric tribes. He and his family took refu
2 CONC ge in various places in Gōng Üng 廣東 (Guǎngdōng) Province. They changed their names. His grave is in Heavenly Mountain facing southeast in Tëin Yōn Yǒn 清遠縣 (Qīngyuǎn Xiàn), Mũng Lī Yèik 蒙裡驛 (Mēnglǐ Yì), Giū Lũng Hãm 九龍潭 (Jiǔlóng Tá
2 CONC n).
2 CONT
2 CONT Fï's first wife was from the Föng 邡 (Fāng) family. She was the daughter of Official Yĩ Pẽin 儒平 (Rúpíng) from Jî Gï Lî 珠璣里 (Zhūjīlǐ). Her maternal uncles and maternal aunt also had problems dealing with the barbaric tribes. They al
2 CONC so fled with her and her husband to Nãm Bön Tûn 南潘村 (Nánpāncūn). She had four sons: Mù, Xün, Yëin, and Hōi. Fï's second wife was from the Hẽo 侯 (hóu) family. She had three sons: Ngùn, Hũ, and Ngĩn.
2 CONT
2 CONT 陈凤台世系研究：广东南雄世系（由陈文至陈猷） http://bbs.chens.org.cn/fengtai/show.aspx?id=444&cid=13
2 CONT
2 CONT 广东第4世祖︰陈辉，又名陈凤台，是陈万山之长子。生于宋高宗绍兴19年己巳 (1149年)，逝于1227年，寿享79岁。皇赐进士第，官封谏议大夫。原配邝氏，妾侯氏，共生谟，宣、瑛，润，恺，图，仁七子。生有七子︰长子谟，次子宣，三子英，四子凯，五子润，六子图，七子仁。陈凤台，宋进士，晚年携七子离南雄珠几巷，迁入珠三角，墓葬清新县禾云镇桂湖村天塘山。清末期其墓曾重修，并建四石柱于墓前。于2004年此墓被政府列为县级重点保护文物。
2 CONT
2 CONT 陈凤台世系 http://bbs.chens.org.cn/fengtai/show.aspx?id=141&cid=13
