1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In Huang Village Chin Family Tree (http://www3.fitnyc.edu/gene_chin/tree) 陳悟 Chén Wù's first son is listed as 仲芳 Zhòngfāng and his third son is listed as 叔芳 Shūfāng. Note that the usual order is 孟, 仲, 叔 meaning fir
2 CONC st, second, and third. It seems that  Chén Wù did not adhere to this order and even used mèng 夢 meaning dream for his second son.
