2 CONT 元隆 Ngũn Lũng (Yuánlóng) was 希堯 Hï Ngẽl's second son. He married a woman from the Däng 曾 Céng family. His tomb was in Äp Nā Hǎng 鴨乸坑 (Yānǎkēng). 
