2 CONT 斗秀 Ēo Xiü (Dǒuxìu) was the first son of 必恩 Bēik Yïn. He married a woman from the Vü 胡 (Hú) family. His tomb was in Ngùk Vâi 玉槐 (Yùhuái) facing south. He had three sons: 子賢 Dū Yẽn, 文 Dū Mũn, and 子昌 Dū Chëng. [子昌 Dū Chëng was given 
2 CONC to 斗祥 Ēo Tẽng to raise as his own son.]
