2 CONC ten sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note on Generation Numbers (145, 137, 104, 22, 18世)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Bon Sim is a 145th generation descendant of Huang Di (the Yellow Emperor) (2,697-2,597 BC), and following the patrilineal line of descent:
2 CONT * a 137th generation descendant of Gui Shun Di, 媯舜帝, 9,1G (2,305-2,205 BC)
2 CONT * a 104th generation descendant of Chén Hú Gōng 陳胡公, 42, 34,1G the first ruler of the Chen Kingdom
2 CONT * a 22th generation descendant of Chén Xuān 陳宣 (1174-1256) who established the 石頭新會 (Stone Village, Xin Hui, Guangdong, China) branch of the family
2 CONT * a 18th generation descendant of Chén Tiānxiáng 裔昌/從善/天祥, 128,120,87,40,5,1G who established the 上閣東山台山縣 (Shangge, Dongshan, Taishan County, Guangdong, China) branch of the family.
